@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK KR
skinparam defaultFontColor #132C35
skinparam ArrowColor #426269
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #8FA6A9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F0F7F5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #567279
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F0F7F5
hide footbox

actor "사용자" as Player
participant "Clock" as Clock
participant "Universe" as Universe
participant "LifeBoard" as Board
participant "BoundaryPolicy" as Policy
participant "Neighborhood" as Root

Player -> Universe : Wrap Around 선택
Universe -> Clock : stop()
Universe -> Board : setBoundaryPolicy(WRAP_AROUND)
note right of Board : recalculateAll = true\n현재 셀 배치 유지

Player -> Clock : Tick (Single Step)
Clock -> Universe : tick()
Universe -> Board : step()
Board -> Policy : outsideNeighbor(root)
Policy --> Board : root
Board -> Root : figureNextState(..., true)
Root --> Board : 변경 여부
note right of Board : recalculateAll = false
alt 변경된 셀이 있음
  Board -> Root : transition()
else 안정 상태
  Board -> Root : clearActiveEdges()
end
Board --> Universe : 실제 변경 여부
opt 화면 갱신이 필요함
  Universe -> Universe : refreshNow()
end
@enduml
